<title>USA: TWA, Meredith form alliance.</title>
<headline>TWA, Meredith form alliance.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans World Airlines Inc said Wednesday it formed a new marketing alliance with Better Homes and Gardens Real Estate Service, an operating group of Meredith Corp.</p>
<p>The marketing agreement awards Frequent Flight Bonus Program miles to a pre-registered flight bonus program member buying or selling their home.</p>
<p>The program will offer up to 40,000 flight bonus program miles to eligible members of the program who buy or sell their homes through a Better Homes and Gardens real estate company.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
